  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:200px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Electric-Heat Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Prypiatosian-B_NRG_True_Form.webp/revision/latest?cb=20241007054913\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Prypiatosian-B NRG True Form\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Prypiatosian-B_NRG_True_Form.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/206?cb=20241007054913\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Prypiatosian-B_NRG_True_Form.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/206?cb=20241007054913 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Prypiatosian-B_NRG_True_Form.webp/revision/latest?cb=20241007054913 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Prypiatosian-B NRG True Form\" width=\"206\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"Prypiatosian-B_NRG_True_Form.webp\" data-image-name=\"Prypiatosian-B NRG True Form.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Prypiatosian-Bs (Ben 10) can absorb energy, especially electricity, which feeds them and gets converted to various properties if their naturally radioactive energy, including heat.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb electricity and convert it to heat.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert electricity into heat</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Electrical Heat Conversion</li>\n<li>Electric Heat</li>\n<li>Electricity To Heat Conversion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can convert electricity into heat, and manipulate it however they please. The subject can either be transformed completely, partially, permanently or temporarily depending on what level of power the user has, with some users being able to induce and reverse the effect at will.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electrical_Conversion\" title=\"Electrical Conversion\">Electrical Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Thermal Ionization\">Thermal Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Energizing\" title=\"Electric Energizing\">Electric Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Absorption\" title=\"Electricity Absorption\">Electricity Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much electricity user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Manipulation\" title=\"Ice Manipulation\">Ice Manipulation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Manipulation\" title=\"Cold Manipulation\">Cold Manipulation</a> can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in environments with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FElectric-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://avatar.fandom.com/wiki/Firebending\">Firebenders</a> (<i>Avatar: The Last Airbender/The Legend of Korra</i>) potentially as a heat source.</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Prypiatosian-B\">Prypiatosian-Bs</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Sango_Yasuke\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Sango Yasuke\">Sango Yasuke</a> (<i>Black Sun</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blacksun.fandom.com/wiki/Sango_Sekiryu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blacksun:Sango Sekiryu\">Sango Sekiryu</a> (<i>Black Sun</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Nathan_Craig_Jones_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Nathan Craig Jones (New Earth)\">Nathan Craig Jones/Coldcast</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Bishop_(Earth-1191)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Lucas Bishop (Earth-1191)\">Lucas Bishop</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valiant.fandom.com/wiki/Solar_(Valiant_Comics)\">Doctor Solar</a> (<i>Valiant Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260806203228\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 220/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!